    {
      "text": "%spark\njoin_df.write.format(\"noop\").mode(\"overwrite\").save(\"/FileStore/tables/suankiData/processed/transaction\")\n\n// one job\n//three stages  -- 1 stage: exchange the key from customre: exchange has partions and sortby key\n                // 2 stage: exchange the key from transacton exchange has partition and sort by key\n                // 3 sort merge join and write to df",
