    {
      "text": "### coalesce\n\n- where does parittions schem go i.g range partition go(i mean  a logical chunk of data that is stored on a single node in a cluster.)\n- coalese merge the file within same executor and it does not do any shuffle\n- since there is no shuffle spark does not run partitions scheme remain same",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
