    {
      "text": "\n-  hashpartitoining  \n   hash(key)%shufflepartion\n- once the data in shuffle partition,sort the key\n- key matched will join the data frame",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
