      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "05acabe9ce2449bb82fdb"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n**What do you think for above how many jobs and stage would be created ?**\n\nSimple Answer: no action no job, but below we calling show then fallowing thing will  happen\n`\nsingle job, but three stage\n1st stage to read customer data-->filter--> sort -->exchange the shuffle  200  --> sort\n2nd stage to read transaction data -> filter --> sort within partition -> exchange 200 --> sort\n3rd stage toshuffle reade from 1st and 2nd ---> sort merge join\n`",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
